<title>UK: General Cable active amid stock placing.</title>
<headline>General Cable active amid stock placing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in General Cable Plc were active after a placing of stock by Lehman Brothers, dealers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The stock was down 1p at 179-1/2 in volume of 66.6 million shares.</p>
<p>No-one at the company was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
